openwitty (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First public release: control of the LEWITT CONNECT 2 (every setting
    verified on the real device), desktop volume integration with an optional
    background service and tray icon, desktop names for the inputs and the
    output, presets, simulated device. Unofficial; not made by LEWITT.
    Tested with one CONNECT 2 on one system (KDE Plasma 6, PipeWire).

